/dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">はしばみ・はり</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">凹</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>凹陷；中空；下沉</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">オウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">くぼ.む・へこ.む・ぼこ</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">凸凹</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">でこぼこ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">凹凸不平；粗糙；崎岖；不平等；失衡；不均匀；差异</span></li><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">凹む</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">へこむ</span><span class=\"k-wz\">凹陷；凹进；下沉；塌陷；坍塌；被击败；被压倒；屈服；认输；放弃；灰心丧气；情绪低落；沮丧；遭受损失；亏损</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">艶</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>光泽；艳丽；魅力；妖艳；有光泽</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">エン</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">つや・なま.めかしい・あで.やか・つや.めく・なま.めく</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"><li><span class=\"k-w\" lang=\"ja\">艶</span><span class=\"kana\" lang=\"ja\">えん</span><span class=\"k-wz\">迷人的；魅力十足的；丰满妖艳的</span></li></ul></div></li>","<li class=\"kcard\"><div class=\"k-ch\" lang=\"ja\">惣</div><div class=\"k-body\"><p class=\"k-m\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../../n1/kanji/\">N1</a>全部；一切</p><dl class=\"k-yomi\"><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">音读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">音読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">ソウ</dd><dt><span class=\"t-zh\">训读</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">訓読み</span></dt><dd lang=\"ja\">すべ.て</dd></dl><ul class=\"k-ws\"></ul></div></li>"